{"availability":"available","full":"prashant08062-arch/voice-compliance-agent","name":"voice-compliance-agent","description":"AI proposes. Rules verify. Voice executes. — multi-agent voice AI with a deterministic Compliance Governor, counterfactual memory & post-call learning. Live demo in homepage.","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-14T01:49:05Z","updated":"2026-09-15T08:16:50Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://voice-compliance-agent-prashant08062-3309s-projects.vercel.app","topics":["ai-agents","compliance","customer-experience","neon","nextjs","postgresql","prisma","typescript","vercel","voice-ai"],"demo":"https://voice-compliance-agent-prashant08062-3309s-projects.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.093Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.093Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.093Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.093Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A multi-agent voice AI for live customer service calls where an LLM committee drafts responses, a deterministic Compliance Governor verifies every proposal against regulatory / financial / escalation / privacy rules, and only approved scripts reach the customer's ears.","Autonomous voice agents fail in production for one reason: nobody can explain, after the fact, why the machine said what it said. This project is a working answer to that problem — agentic reasoning with accountability bolted in at the right place in the pipeline:","Every rejected utterance is kept in counterfactual memory, and every completed call writes a conversation journal entry that correlates decisions with outcomes — so the system learns what actually works, not just what was compliant."],"features":["AI proposes — listening agents read tone, tenure, account value and policy, then a Response Thesis Agent drafts a bold response intent.","R